From ba53b611b08b3e1019cf925abb4f48168562810f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pablo <pablolabs23@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Jul 2026 11:04:54 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add virtual controller support to Windows.Gaming.Input

- Add UDP client support to read controller state from MiceWine virtual controller (port 7941)
- Implement provider_create_virtual() to create virtual controller provider
- Modify provider functions to handle virtual controller (Type, AxisCount, ButtonCount, SwitchCount, State, Vibration)
- Add ws2_32 dependency for socket support
- Enable Windows.Gaming.Input to detect Windroid-emu virtual controller for Unity games
